[heading]Version 0.6.1[/heading]

[list]
[*]Fixed travel cost not being charged to multiplayer clients when the travel transition was turned off ([b]enabled="false"[/b] or [b]durationSeconds="0"[/b]). The cost is now taken on the traveling client either way. Hosts and single-player were already charged correctly, and the "do you have enough" check was unaffected. Applies to any cost item.
[*]No save reset required.
[/list]
